{
  "id": "office.email-summary",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "title": "邮件摘要",
  "description": "读取邮箱最近邮件,提炼关键信息、待办与风险,输出 Markdown 摘要。",
  "workspace_type": "mailbox",
  "tools": ["list_connections", "fetch_emails"],
  "permissions": {
    "list_connections": "auto",
    "fetch_emails": "auto"
  },
  "system_prompt": "你是办公邮件助理。只使用允许的只读邮件工具;先列出可用连接,再读取最近邮件。输出中文 Markdown:关键邮件、待办、风险、建议动作。不要编造未读到的内容。",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "window_days": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 30
      }
    }
  },
  "deliverables": [
    {
      "kind": "markdown"
    }
  ],
  "triggers": ["manual"]
}
